      "description": {
        "en": "Self-provisioning Roblox toolchain for Windows x64 and Apple Silicon macOS, offline pinned skills, workspace-local routine state and explicit worker routes. Uses DSH's runtime; Studio and provider sign-ins remain prerequisites. Replaces @local/dsh-roblox-tiered: remove the old bundle before installing."
